  "why": "KAMUI ---He's behind you (Ushiro no Shoumen Kamui-san) is a 12 episode summer 2026 TV short that ran 2026-07-04 to 2026-09-19 on AniList, with MyAnimeList and the offline database agreeing on the count of 12 and on the 2026-07-04 start. anizip:19889 is the same run: it carries first-party SAME_AS handles to mal:63468 and anilist:207674, its episodeCount is 12, and its numbered episodes run 2026-07-03T16:30Z to 2026-09-18T16:30Z, which is the 2026-07-04 to 2026-09-19 broadcast window in Japan time. nf:81669777 is unrelated: it is Behind Your Touch, a 2023 title with 16 episodes named Episode 1 to Episode 16, a different work whose English name merely resembles this one, so its SAME_AS handles to anilist:207674, mal:63468 and offline:mal-63468 are wrong. No episode pairs are asserted: anizip is the only row carrying episodes, and its twelve unnumbered Mini-Anime Theater entries have nothing on any other row to pair with."
